69:| Agent | Best For | Model | Temperature |
70:|-------|----------|-------|-------------|
71:| **Research Analyst** | Deep research with citations | Claude Opus | 0.3 |
72:| **Sentiment Monitor** | Social listening, brand perception | Claude Sonnet | 0.5 |
73:| **Competitive Intel** | Competitor tracking, market positioning | Claude Sonnet | 0.2 |
74:| **Financial Analyst** | Financial statement analysis, metrics | Claude Opus | 0.1 |
75:| **Market Researcher** | TAM sizing, market trends | Claude Sonnet | 0.3 |
76:| **Expert Synthesizer** | Synthesizing expert opinions | Claude Opus | 0.4 |
78:#### Step 4: Schedule (Optional)
