carol: 51% (optimistic)

Team consensus: 42% (median)
Range: 13% spread
```

**Features:**
- Each user has own probability estimate
- Shared drivers, evidence, discussion
- Conflict-free merging (CRDTs handle it)
- Real-time presence (cursors, typing indicators)
