## Daily Development Cycle

### 1. Starting Your Day

```bash
# Pull latest changes
cd ~/uffp
git pull origin main

# Start all services
./scripts/dev.sh

# Verify services are healthy
docker ps
curl http://localhost:8080/health     # Backend API
curl http://localhost:8081/health     # Agent proxy
curl http://localhost:8082/health     # Sync server

# Check agent status
curl http://localhost:8081/agents/status | jq
```

### 2. Working on a Feature

```bash
# Create feature branch
git checkout -b feature/fermi-constraint-engine

# Run UFFP in dev mode (hot reload)
cargo run --bin uffp-cli -- --dev

# Or run GUI
cargo run --bin uffp-ui -- --dev

# Watch tests in another terminal
cargo watch -x "test --workspace"
```

### 3. Making Changes

```bash
# Edit code with your favorite editor
zed .
# or
nvim crates/uffp-dsl/src/parser.rs

# Run formatter
cargo fmt --all

# Run clippy for lints
cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings

# Run tests for specific crate
cargo test -p uffp-dsl

# Run integration tests
cargo test --test integration_tests
```

### 4. Testing Your Changes

```bash
# Unit tests
cargo test --lib

# Integration tests  
cargo test --test '*'

# End-to-end tests (requires services running)
cargo test --test e2e_forecast_lifecycle

# Test specific function
cargo test test_fermi_decomposition -- --nocapture

# Benchmark performance (for simulation engine)
cargo bench --bench monte_carlo
```

### 5. Committing Work

```bash
# Stage changes
