## Performance Optimization

### Profiling

```bash
# CPU profiling with flamegraph
cargo flamegraph --bin uffp-cli -- simulate --iterations 100000

# Memory profiling with heaptrack  
heaptrack cargo run --bin uffp-cli -- simulate --iterations 100000
heaptrack_gui heaptrack.uffp-cli.*.gz

# Profile specific function
cargo instruments --template time --bin uffp-cli -- \
  simulate --iterations 100000

# Benchmark with criterion
cargo bench --bench monte_carlo -- --verbose
```

### Optimization Checklist

- [ ] Use `cargo build --release` for production
- [ ] Enable LTO (Link-Time Optimization) in Cargo.toml
- [ ] Profile before optimizing
- [ ] Use `rayon` for parallel simulation iterations
- [ ] Cache expensive computations (distributions, agent embeddings)
- [ ] Use `SmallVec` for small collections
- [ ] Avoid allocations in hot loops
- [ ] Use `Cow<str>` for clone-on-write strings
- [ ] Consider `unsafe` only after profiling proves necessity

