## Deployment

### Building Release Binary

```bash
# Build optimized binary
cargo build --release

# Binary location
./target/release/uffp-cli
./target/release/uffp-ui

# Strip symbols to reduce size
strip target/release/uffp-cli

# Cross-compile for macOS (from Linux)
cargo build --release --target aarch64-apple-darwin

# Package for distribution
tar -czf uffp-v0.1.0-linux-x86_64.tar.gz -C target/release uffp-cli uffp-ui
```

### Docker Images

